{"id":70326,"date":"2025-11-23T19:40:33","date_gmt":"2025-11-23T18:40:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70326"},"modified":"2026-10-20T22:39:14","modified_gmt":"2026-10-20T21:39:14","slug":"sao-silvestre-de-vila-nova-de-tazem","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-de-vila-nova-de-tazem\/","title":{"rendered":"2\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Nova de Tazem 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"70326\" class=\"elementor elementor-70326 elementor-bc-flex-widget\" data-elementor-post-type=\"ajde_events\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f93804 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0f93804\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c4fdbf1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"c4fdbf1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">2\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Nova de Tazem 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>2\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Nova de Tazem 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>26 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com epicentro na <strong>Avenida Dr. Joaquim Borges<\/strong> (junto ao edif\u00edcio dos Correios), em <strong>Vila Nova de Tazem<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Gouveia<\/strong>, distrito da <strong>Guarda<\/strong>. O programa oficial arranca \u00e0s <strong>15:00<\/strong> com a partida da Caminhada de 8 km, seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong>15:30<\/strong> o tiro de partida para a prova competitiva de 10 km.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Situada no sop\u00e9 ocidental da <strong>Serra da Estrela<\/strong>, numa vila hist\u00f3rica do concelho de Gouveia c\u00e9lebre pelo seu patrim\u00f3nio beir\u00e3o e tradi\u00e7\u00e3o vitivin\u00edcola do D\u00e3o, a prova desafia-te num circuito urbano de 3,4 km percorrido tr\u00eas vezes para completar os <strong>10 km<\/strong> (com um ganho de eleva\u00e7\u00e3o de <strong>210m D+<\/strong> e inclina\u00e7\u00e3o m\u00e9dia de 4,3%), enquanto a <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> explora maioritariamente o espa\u00e7o rural envolvente. Todos os inscritos beneficiam de t-shirt t\u00e9cnica do evento, abastecimento, banhos nas piscinas cont\u00edguas ao Centro Cultural e o tradicional lanche-conv\u00edvio de feijoada.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Esta segunda edi\u00e7\u00e3o conta com a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o conjunta do <strong>Centro de Cultura e Desporto de Vila Nova de Tazem<\/strong> e da <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Vila Nova de Tazem<\/strong>, assegurando cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica com controlo de voltas, seguro desportivo e medalhas para os tr\u00eas primeiros classificados masculinos e femininos de cada escal\u00e3o na corrida principal. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: brea